TE5eLimAgCKmtcuDwRhZi0PgXhm.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"私の気持ちを受け取ってくださいませ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/GYZfEpJorKADsDHc9R0CWMDgI345IwHD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"どうぞご堪能ください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/vVmie7wxTZo0Ktb8s4sAscVl1gqfYPnq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"これでもっと完璧な…「ウサギ」になれますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/guHZGKrt4s9SXHJ4MKnMaULrc0qcmnv1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"さあ、それではお掃除を始めましょうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/UIUF8dbbUSWzJRmdhpU4ZiyYi1DiGpUV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"普段より胸が高鳴って、これも、ご主人と一緒にいるからでしょうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/QOUdG6tFjvvgxtA5ZQf5lPz64uINuJOD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ご主人様のメイド、アカネです。いえ…今はご主人様のウサギさん、と申し上げるべきでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/jYmm0AeQuvU8q79YrQZVSwWbouWfTBxx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ご主人様のご期待にお応えできるように……洗練されてきました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/XkNr3OsGOad43dDBmpT8ZdSVkKDg3sZt.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"メイドとしても、ウサギとしても、ご主人様のお役に立てますように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/n4mlLyvlmkWU7nbuLpgyKkuYnjUou6Uq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"成長しましたよ？ぴょん、ぴょん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/DAAgD0zQrcyNkb1DiKtXFGWMhIvR8Tsi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ご主人様のご期待にお応えできるように……洗練されてきました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/FEMHP28ZZFeJPAgyawAihxWXH2SBrwYt.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ウサギになりきるのは楽しいか…ですか？うふふ、そうですね…どう見えます？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/hObKfG7vtJCFYDCGbXjoouR1OUqjR1do.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ご要望がありましたら、いつでもお申し付けください。お待ちしておりますので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/yy9xhRrpFbrdu7joRq0r8T4lQZIIXwqH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ご主人様とのこの一瞬は、私にとってかけがえのない大切な時間です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/z2SCDeWQI7An1gMdzIejEe4wJV6NXHa6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"爆弾は一番効率的な掃除道具なんですよ。じょ、冗談です…そんな目で見ないでください、ご主人様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/7gPQajSAyFvbQ1gBjdiZ7QRHWtwpnwQd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ウサギになりきる事は、より完璧なエージェントに近づくための一歩。 もしくは、より完璧なメイドに近づくための一歩かもしれませんね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/iiMlOo0WuCHVrgcZZdDS7l2ltLkTMghM.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"申し訳ございません…こんな考え、メイドとしては失格のはずなのに。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/IKmfYaCGaOUHWfQhLOhKvl8fPQwwQLHH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私…自信をなくしておりました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/jY3NTDOPBCA24BjJ5ox6AGnTaMp6YO1E.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ご主人様はいつも多くのものを背負っていて、それなのに大丈夫だと笑っていて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/EFYpVPoCN9IzGZoJdoCyfNsonHyVAp5N.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私は…全然その重荷を、代わりに持って差し上げられず…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/aAB8CxZeKcf2xMdwEXHji94IOJis9qbe.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ですが、ご主人様のお言葉で、再び前を向けそうです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/NqiD85EeUifg51GUxbAURv4w8SjUBWQq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"これからも、ふつつかものですが何卒よろしくお願いいたします。ご主人様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/wkvADiUcZNG08DICOQOfC95hJi99TZE8.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ウサギには愛が必要なんですよ？ぴょん、ぴょん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/V90AY8TgIikSCbxUh8WcqC2JwLmUXqTB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ありがとうございます、ご主人様。これからもご期待ください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/Uk8ewo0DIvvdf9RNFEl086o02WIjymbe.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"すべてご主人様のおかげです。ふふっ、本当に…すべてが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/qqaOXOY0iIVqYs8NQzwkJcoQogaOowS0.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ウサギのアカネを、逃がさないでくださいね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/Pmq4OZJ8k6mraqXzAwcOr71i5XI2dfFg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お待ちしておりました、ご主人様。アカネはご主人様だけの忠実なウサギです。ぴょんぴょん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/yRqPSH7DCh4R1viQB3WzPLStPzi2vLb1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"おかえりなさいませ、ご主人様。準備は全て終わっております…勤勉なウサギですから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/jOkiNSrhx9KMxkKGXMpaKGA79ONxpYgT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私の誕生日を覚えてくださっていたのですか？ありがとうございます、ご主人様。 これ以上に嬉しいことはございません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/laZXGXEwEKCwHlbZq3i0cniycxrTeNch.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、ご主人様！ 本日は、ウサギからの特別なご奉仕を、期待していてくださいね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/2cZKx7TaDxq1jRelXX5ybqWZbzIb2b23.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ウサギの特別な奉仕、ですか？ うふふ…さあ、何でしょうね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/uLJasA7PDUnm3nL7A4m5E2aFJBjsZImr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Birthday_Player_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"大丈夫。怖くないですよ～さあ、よしよし…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/O0gMKAEJkm1TXwldMhRIaPgbU98DZxcG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あ、ハロウィーンですね。私のこの格好も、今日だけは普通に見えますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/Qvbh4DMWqD7AwknNo5jzYICp9zEm7ZFn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"それで…どんなイタズラがいいですか？お菓子をくださっても、イタズラはしますからね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/lmRygngNQfvhqHmKo6uD2udaargF81Qw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あけましておめでとうございます、ご主人様。 …もう新年ですね。今年は本当に良い事がたくさんありますように…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/gI5rnwbsJs6S25w3LUSTj5gnjZDIeTDN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0099_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"クリスマスですね、ご主人様。 ご主人様となら毎日が特別ですが…今日はとびきり特別な日です。 寒がっているウサギのために…おそばにいてくださりませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/hhJTk03Zjl0aDuUw0m4gFdKZOH1ln5p3.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0099_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"收拾干净了呢。 打扫卫生…… 是很重要的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"欢迎光临。 要点一杯红茶吗？ ……呵呵","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"主人真的…… 是一个很特别的人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"嗯…… 哪里还需要 再整理一下吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"趁此机会， 和主人一起， 漫步在兔兔之路上……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"放在这里了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"这是今天要打扫的目标吗。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"弄得真乱……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"让我来收拾干净吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"好了，请拿好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"请收下我的心意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"来，请尽情享用哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"这样就能成为更完美的……“兔兔”了呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"好了，那就开始打扫吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"感觉心跳得比平时更快呢……这是因为，和主人在一起吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是主人的女仆，茜。 啊不……现在，应该说我是主人的兔兔了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"有没有稍微帮到您一点呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"无论是身为女仆，还是身为兔兔，我都希望能帮上主人的忙。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"兔兔成长啦~蹦蹦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"为了不辜负主人的期待，我一直在好好锻炼。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"问我变成兔兔开不开心？ 呵呵，这个嘛……您觉得呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果您想要什么， 请随时告诉我。 我一直都在。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"和主人一起度过的每个瞬间， 对我来说都是无可替代的宝贵时光。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"炸弹是最有效的打扫工具之一。我、我开玩笑的。 请不要那样看着我，主人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"我认为，成为兔兔 是成为完美特工的一种方式。又或者， 是成为更完美女仆的一种方式。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"我正等你呢，主人。茜是只属于主人的忠诚兔兔，蹦蹦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，主人。 所有准备工作都已经完成了，因为我是一只勤劳的兔兔。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"非常抱歉。  有这样的想法， 是我身为女仆的失职。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"我……失去了自信。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"主人一直背负着很多重担，  可即便如此，您还是会笑着，说没关系。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我……没能替您， 背负那份重担……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"可是，听了主人的话， 我再一次找回了自信。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"虽然，我还有很多不足之处， 但今后，还是请主人多多关照了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"兔兔需要爱哦。蹦蹦~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"多谢主人，今后，也请拭目以待吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"这一切都是主人的功劳。呵呵，真的，所有一切……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"请不要错过兔兔茜啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"您竟然记得我的生日？谢谢您，主人。 茜实在太高兴了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，主人！请期待兔兔今天的……特别服务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"你问兔兔的特别服务是什么？呵呵…… 这个嘛，会是什么呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"没关系，不需要害怕。 好了，乖~乖……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_birthday_player_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"真是热闹的节日啊， 今年的兔兔茜也会一如既往地为主人服务哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，今天是万圣节啊。 我这身打扮在今天看起来应该很普通吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"对了……主人喜欢什么样的恶作剧？ 就算给我糖的话，我也会捣蛋的哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0099_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"今天是特别的一天呢， 让兔兔茜为主人准备好月饼和茶水吧，蹦蹦~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%A4%E7%AC%A0%20%E8%8C%9C/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/cn/ch0099_season_mida